{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15575,\"date\":\"2026-06-17T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-17T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-20th-anniversary-due-tagli-insieme-foldable-seconda-generazione\",\"title\":\"iPhone 20th Anniversary in due tagli e insieme al Foldable di seconda generazione\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple starebbe preparando iPhone per il 20° anniversario in due dimensioni e il lancio in parallelo di un iPhone pieghevole di seconda generazione, con chip A21 a processo a 2 nanometri.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/Mostly-Screen-iPhone-Purple-Feature-2027-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Mostly-Screen-iPhone-Purple-Feature-2027\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15570,\"date\":\"2026-06-16T20:28:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-16T18:28:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-2028-apple-chip-a22-pro-14-nm\",\"title\":\"iPhone 2028: Apple punta a chip A22 Pro da processo 1,4 nm\",\"excerpt\":\"Per i modelli iPhone di fascia alta previsti nel 2028, Apple starebbe passando da chip a 2 nm a una nuova generazione a 1,4 nm. TSMC produrrebbe la maggior parte dei chip A22 Pro, con valutazioni anche su un coinvolgimento di Intel.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/apple-silicon-1-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-silicon-1-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15329,\"date\":\"2026-06-08T12:53:20+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T10:53:20+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-touch-id-al-posto-del-face-id\",\"title\":\"iPhone Ultra: Touch ID al posto del Face ID sul modello pieghevole\",\"excerpt\":\"Le indiscrezioni sul prossimo iPhone pieghevole chiamato iPhone Ultra indicano un cambio importante: Touch ID al posto del Face ID.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/iphone-ultra-touch-id-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-ultra-touch-id\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15331,\"date\":\"2026-06-08T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-06-08T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-pieghevole-nuove-immagini-dummy-design-colore-bianco\",\"title\":\"iPhone pieghevole: nuove immagini del dummy svelano il design e il possibile colore bianco\",\"excerpt\":\"Le immagini di un dummy unit del presunto iPhone pieghevole mostrano un design più definito del previsto: display esterno edge-to-edge, fotocamere in una placca orizzontale e l’ipotesi che il dispositivo possa arrivare solo in bianco.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/foldable-iphone-dummy-sonny-dickson-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"foldable-iphone-dummy-sonny-dickson\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15259,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T14:30:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:39:02+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-macbook-ultra-iphone-pieghevole-novita-in-arrivo\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, MacBook Ultra e iPhone pieghevole: le novità in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi leak su Siri in iOS 27, rumor su un possibile “MacBook Ultra”, aggiornamenti su Apple Watch per il monitoraggio glicemico e prime indicazioni sull’iPhone pieghevole.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/top-stories-2026-05-30-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top-stories-2026-05-30\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15226,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T13:30:04+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:24:01+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-lente-diaframma-variabile-piu-cara\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: lente a diaframma variabile più cara per Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Ming-Chi Kuo, la nuova lente a diaframma variabile dell’iPhone 18 Pro costerà ad Apple circa il 50% in più rispetto ai modelli attuali.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-17-pro-black-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-pro-black-feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15224,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T12:30:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-30T10:37:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-colori-dummy-sonny-dickson\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro, i colori in anteprima con i dummy di Sonny Dickson\",\"excerpt\":\"Sonny Dickson ha condiviso immagini di dummy di iPhone 18 Pro nei quattro colori attesi: Light Blue, Black, Silver e Dark Cherry. Prime indicazioni sul look finale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-18-pro-color-dummies-768x435.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-color-dummies\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15164,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-10-novita-rumor-maggio-2026\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: 10 novità in arrivo secondo i rumor di maggio 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Tra i rumor su iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max: Face ID parzialmente sotto lo schermo, Dynamic Island più piccola, display LTPO+ e supporto 5G via satellite.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Four-iPhone-18-Pro-Colors-Mock-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Four-iPhone-18-Pro-Colors-Mock-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15162,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"leaker-smentisce-rumor-pro-iphone-tornerebbero-titanio\",\"title\":\"Leaker smentisce i rumor: i Pro iPhone non tornerebbero al titanio\",\"excerpt\":\"Un leaker Weibo sostiene che i Pro iPhone difficilmente torneranno al titanio a breve: la gestione termica dell’AI locale favorirebbe l’alluminio.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iPhone-15-Pro-Cameras-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-15-Pro-Cameras\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d5635