iphone-19-pro-prototipo-display-quad-curved-face-id-sotto-schermo\",\"title\":\"iPhone 19 Pro, prototipo con display quad-curved e Face ID sotto schermo\",\"excerpt\":\"Un leaker cinese sostiene che Apple stia testando un iPhone 19 Pro con display quad-curved e Face ID completamente nascosto sotto il pannello.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Mostly-Screen-iPhone-Purple-Feature-2027-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Mostly-Screen-iPhone-Purple-Feature-2027\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15025,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T20:30:54+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T10:00:13+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ipad-pieghevole-grande-design-senza-piega-iphone-ultra\",\"title\":\"iPad pieghevole grande: possibile design senza piega con iPhone Ultra\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su un grande iPad pieghevole in sviluppo: potrebbe adottare un hinge senza piega simile a quello attribuito all’ipotetico iPhone Ultra, atteso in autunno.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPad\",\"categorySlug\":\"ipad\",\"categoryId\":10,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/FoldPad-Redux-24-Magenta-and-Blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"FoldPad-Redux-24-Magenta-and-Blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15023,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T19:30:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T10:00:03+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-valuta-liquid-metal-e-titanio-migliorato-per-futuri-iphone-pro\",\"title\":\"Apple valuta liquid metal e titanio migliorato per futuri iPhone Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor su Apple: dopo l’uso di titanio e poi alluminio, l’azienda starebbe ancora lavorando a liquid metal e a leghe di titanio migliorate per i prossimi iPhone Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-17-pro-air-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-pro-air\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14982,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T17:30:14+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:07:27+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-pieghevole-produzione-prova-bloccata-problemi-cerniera\",\"title\":\"iPhone pieghevole: produzione in prova bloccata per problemi di cerniera\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker, la produzione in prova dell’iPhone pieghevole (probabile “iPhone Ultra”) sarebbe rallentata da problemi di affidabilità della cerniera.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14976,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T16:00:36+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:07:05+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-watch-ultra-4-redesign-monitoraggio-pressione\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Ultra 4: redesign e monitoraggio della pressione\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo DigiTimes, Apple Watch Ultra 4 potrebbe arrivare con un redesign e una nuova funzione di notifiche per l’ipertensione, in revisione FDA.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Ultra-2-Black-Titanium\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14877,\"date\":\"2026-05-14T20:30:51+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-14T15:51:04+00:00\",\"slug\":\"indagine-pochi-utenti-smartphone-puntano-su-foldable-o-ai\",\"title\":\"Indagine: pochi utenti smartphone puntano su foldable o AI\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un sondaggio CNET/YouGov, solo il 13% valuterebbe un upgrade per telefoni pieghevoli e il 12% per integrazioni AI.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14875,\"date\":\"2026-05-14T17:00:39+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-14T08:54:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"aspettare-prima-di-comprare-nuovo-iphone\",\"title\":\"Perché potrebbe convenire aspettare prima di comprare un nuovo iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo i rumor, Apple starebbe lavorando a un iPhone per il 20° anniversario con un grande redesign: ecco perché potrebbe valere la pena aspettare.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/You-Might-Want-to-Wait-to-Buy-a-New-iPhone-Feature-2.5-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"You-Might-Want-to-Wait-to-Buy-a-New-iPhone-Feature-2.5\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14798,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T16:00:44+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:59:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"11-motivi-per-aspettare-iphone-18-pro\",\"title\":\"11 motivi per aspettare iPhone 18 Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo i rumor, iPhone 18 Pro potrebbe arrivare con cambiamenti su design, batteria, Dynamic Island, display, chip e modem, oltre a novità camera e connettività satellitare 5G.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14671,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T15:36:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:36:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-piu-riparabile-foldable\",\"title\":\"“iPhone Ultra” potrebbe essere il pieghevole più riparabile\",\"excerpt\":\"Il leaker Instant Digital sostiene che il design interno dell’iPhone Ultra renderebbe lo smontaggio e la riparazione più semplici rispetto ad altri pieghevoli.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-Iridescent-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-Iridescent-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":6,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14667,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T15:36:01+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:36:01+00:00\",\"slug\":\"leaker-apple-ritarda-iphone-18-strategia-di-mercato\",\"title\":\"Leaker: Apple ritarda iPhone 18 per strategia di mercato\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo il leaker “Fixed Focus Digital”, Apple avrebbe scelto di ritardare l’iPhone 18 standard per estendere le vendite di iPhone 17, ridurre i costi e rafforzarsi contro i rivali Android.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-17-models-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-models\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14643,\"date\":\"2026-05-06T15:00:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-06T07:08:45+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-potrebbe-avvicinarsi-a-iphone-18e-componenti-condivisi\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 potrebbe avvicinarsi molto a iPhone 18e: indiscrezioni su componenti condivisi\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo il leaker “Fixed Focus Digital”, iPhone 18 e iPhone 18e condividerebbero alcuni componenti, suggerendo un restringimento del divario tra i due modelli.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-17e-notch-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17e-notch\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14631,\"date\":\"2026-05-06T09:06:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-06T07:06:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-finitura-alluminio-anodizzato-rumor\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: confermata la finitura in alluminio anodizzato?\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker, iPhone 18 Pro manterrà la finitura in alluminio anodizzato già introdotta con iPhone 17 Pro, nonostante le lamentele sulla durata.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Four-iPhone-18-Pro-Colors-Mock-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Four-iPhone-18-Pro-Colors-Mock-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14471,\"date\":\"2026-04-28T00:37:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-27T22:37:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-due-nuovi-prodotti-ultra\",\"title\":\"Apple: in arrivo due nuovi prodotti “Ultra”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Macworld, Apple pianifica di lanciare un “iPhone Ultra” pieghevole e un “MacBook Ultra” con display OLED e touchscreen nel prossimo anno.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Apple-Logo-Black-768x429.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14441,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-pieghevole-possibili-5-funzioni-mancanti-2000-dollari\",\"title\":\"iPhone Ultra pieghevole: possibili 5 funzioni mancanti a 2.000 dollari\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo immagini di dummy, l’iPhone Ultra pieghevole potrebbe mancare MagSafe e Action Button, oltre ad altre funzioni presenti su iPhone 18 Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-Iridescent-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-Iridescent-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14437,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:30+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:30+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-12gb-ram\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 potrebbe arrivare a 12GB di RAM\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo l’analista Dan Nystedt, l’iPhone 18 base potrebbe passare per la prima volta a 12GB di RAM, allineandosi ai modelli Pro dello scorso anno.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/apple-silicon-feature-joeblue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-silicon-feature-joeblue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14417,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:12:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:12:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-piano-upgrade-camera-quattro-fasi\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: Apple valuta un piano di upgrade camera in quattro fasi\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker cinese, Apple starebbe pianificando quattro aggiornamenti per le fotocamere dei futuri iPhone: il primo riguarderebbe l’iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iphone-17-cameras-zoom-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-cameras-zoom\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14399,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:11:43+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:11:43+00:00\",\"slug\":\"dummy-iphone-18-pro-max-plateau-fotocamera-piu-spesso\",\"title\":\"Dummy iPhone 18 Pro Max: possibile plateau fotocamera più spesso\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuove immagini di dummy per iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max suggeriscono un plateau della fotocamera più spesso e lenti che sporgono di più rispetto a iPhone 17 Pro Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iphone-18-pro-17-pro-dummy-comparison402x-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-17-pro-dummy-comparison402x\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14330,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T13:32:41+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T11:32:41+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-quattro-colori-dark-cherry\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: quattro colori in arrivo, incluso “Dark Cherry”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Macworld, iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max potrebbero arrivare con quattro colorazioni, tra cui “Dark Cherry” (rosso vino).\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/macworld-iphone-18-pro-colors-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macworld-iphone-18-pro-colors\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14255,\"date\":\"2026-04-14T08:12:23+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-14T06:12:23+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-deep-red-colore-leaker\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: possibile nuovo colore Deep Red, secondo un leaker\",\"excerpt\":\"Un leaker cinese sostiene che Apple stia testando un nuovo Deep Red per iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, citando prototipi visti su smartphone Android concorrenti.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iPhone-18-Pro-Deep-Red-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-18-Pro-Deep-Red-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14229,\"date\":\"2026-04-14T08:11:01+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-14T06:11:01+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-fold-produzione-rinviata-lancio-2026\",\"title\":\"Produzione iPhone Fold rinviata, ma lancio previsto per il 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo DigiTimes, la produzione dell’iPhone Fold è in ritardo di circa 1-2 mesi, ma Apple punta comunque a un lancio in autunno 2026.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iphone-fold-text-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-fold-text\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14218,\"date\":\"2026-04-11T15:01:11+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-11T13:01:11+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-ancora-indecisa-dynamic-island-iphone-18-pro\",\"title\":\"Apple ancora indecisa sul Dynamic Island dell’iPhone 18 Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo il leaker Digital Chat Station, Apple starebbe valutando due opzioni per il Dynamic Island dell’iPhone 18 Pro: design invariato o una “Mini Dynamic Island” più piccola.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14176,\"date\":\"2026-04-11T14:58:46+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-11T12:58:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"rumor-iphone-pieghevole-cosa-e-cambiato-e-cosa-sappiamo-ora\",\"title\":\"Rumor iPhone pieghevole: cosa è cambiato e cosa sappiamo ora\",\"excerpt\":\"Le indiscrezioni sull’iPhone pieghevole di Apple aumentano: il dispositivo è entrato in una nuova fase di test prima della produzione di massa. Ecco i punti principali su nome, design, tempistiche e prezzo.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Apple-Foldable-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Foldable-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14156,\"date\":\"2026-04-07T22:10:32+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-07T20:10:32+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-fold-foxconn-produzione-di-prova-2026\",\"title\":\"iPhone Fold: Foxconn avvia la produzione di prova prima del lancio 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker cinese, il partner Apple Foxconn avrebbe avviato la produzione di prova dell’iPhone Fold. Apple punta alla produzione di massa a luglio.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iphone-fold-text-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-fold-text\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14150,\"date\":\"2026-04-07T22:08:17+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-07T20:08:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-pieghevole-design-svelato-immagini-modelli-dummy\",\"title\":\"iPhone pieghevole: design svelato in immagini di modelli dummy\",\"excerpt\":\"Sonny Dickson ha condiviso immagini dei primi dummy di iPhone 18 Pro, iPhone 18 Pro Max e del primo iPhone pieghevole, con un design “passport-style”.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPad\",\"categorySlug\":\"ipad\",\"categoryId\":10,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/sonny-dickson-iphone-18-fold-dummy-models-768x417.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"sonny-dickson-iphone-18-fold-dummy-models\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14061,\"date\":\"2026-03-26T21:33:26+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-26T20:33:26+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-fold-potrebbe-arrivare-dopo-iphone-18-pro\",\"title\":\"iPhone Fold potrebbe arrivare dopo iPhone 18 Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, l’iPhone Fold non partirebbe con le stesse tempistiche di settembre di iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max, senza una data precisa.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/iphone-fold-text-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-fold-text\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14059,\"date\":\"2026-03-26T21:33:17+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-26T20:33:17+00:00\",\"slug\":\"niente-grandi-cambiamenti-design-apple-watch-2026\",\"title\":\"Niente grandi cambiamenti di design per Apple Watch nel 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman di Bloomberg, non sono attesi cambiamenti di design importanti per i prossimi modelli di Apple Watch in arrivo più tardi nel 2026.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black-768x431.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Watch-Series-10-Jet-Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13987,\"date\":\"2026-03-24T13:57:20+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-24T12:57:20+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-riorienta-catena-fornitura-display-oled\",\"title\":\"Apple Riorienta la Catena di Fornitura dei Display per una Nuova Ondata di Dispositivi OLED\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta riducendo la sua dipendenza dai produttori cinesi in vista del lancio di nuovi prodotti con pannelli OLED, secondo quanto riportato da DigiTimes.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Apple-MacBook-Pro-M4-hero-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple MacBook Pro M hero\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null}],\"totalPages\":3}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":["tj-posts"]}